    "text": "<p>Cell reaction is :</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Cu</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>Ag</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mi>Cu</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>Ag</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>cell</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>Cell</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>059</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>log</mi><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>Cu</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mfenced><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>Ag</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3095</mn><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>Cell</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>059</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>log</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;.......<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>Cell</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>059</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>log</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>001</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>From <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>28</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>28</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math></p>",
